model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "The new-pin Docker-start diagnostic uses the same checked redaction command as pull, create and readiness, retaining its useful stderr without exposing either database password. Managed Cloud databases use the live port allocated and held by Docker, including cloned database targets. The production-operations alternate endpoint is a scoped listener forwarding to that same database. Pull, create, start and readiness failures retain Docker diagnostics with database passwords redacted; container ownership and scoped removal survive startup failure and interruption. Diagnostic fixtures supply Docker's published-port output before exercising readiness-child failures."
    }
  }
}
